I was accountable and responsible to manage the Financial Control function over in-country Operating Entities.	This is done by completing various reconciliations and providing compliance data for in-country entity financial lodgements. My function plays a critical role in the overall legal entity compliance for the group while also maintaining general ledger integrity.

My primary responsibilities include:
• Comply with local, state, and federal government reporting requirements and tax filings of the Group’s entities; 
• Coordinate the provision of information to external auditors for the annual and interim audits; 
• Ensure all financial statements are correct and precise; 
• Responsible for providing accurate and comprehensive financial information to executive management for long-term financial strategizing; 
• Liaise and coordinate with Group entities for new contracts and compliance; 
