•	Reviewing the purchases and supplier contracts;
•	Reviewing the sales in process by closely working with the sales team; and
•	Reviewing the monthly management accounts.

QBE’s Global Major Trading Partner Engagement (MTPE) Team maintains accountability for the overarching strategies and governance of the Company’s global relationships with our 5 MTP’s.  Working across a matrixed structure, MTPE is committed to a set of operating principles that:

	Ensures an aligned MTP strategy globally;
	Promotes mutual interests, synergies and growth opportunities between QBE and our MTPs; 
	Incorporates strategic performance and progress reviews between QBE and our MTP global  executive teams; and
	Leverages data and analytics capabilities to increase our “share of wallet” position. 

Responsible for supporting MTP governance, stewardship and strategic reporting on a global basis. Serves as the strategic partner for effective MTP alignment, driving data-enabled actionable business strategies to improve performance. In addition, responsible for helping define the analytic framework in which new opportunities are identified, evaluated and prioritized, improving connectivity and data flows between all Divisions and the Global Service Center.

